OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin farmers have mixed harvest
OL,4,
OL,5,FPumpkin growers say they have
OL,6,Fexperienced a mixed year in terms of
OL,7,Fcrops following the hot weather.
OL,9,FNeil 'Pip' Hawken, who runs Pips Pick
OL,10,FYour Own in Yealmpton, Devon, said the
OL,11,Fsummer weather left the farm struggling
OL,12,Fto grow pumpkins ahead of Halloween and
OL,13,Fleft him needing to buy in extra
OL,14,Fsupplies from elsewhere.
OL,16,FBut farmers at Strawberry Fields in
OL,17,FLifton, on the Devon-Cornwall border,
OL,18,Fsaid their clay-heavy soil at their
OL,19,Fsite had helped retain moisture and
OL,20,Fproduce enough for its Pumpkin Fest
OL,21,Fevent during October.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
