OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin farmers have mixed harvest
OL,4,
OL,5,FFarmers across the South West said the
OL,6,Fheatwaves and warm weather during a
OL,7,Fprovisionally record-breaking summer in
OL,8,Fthe UK had caused them issues with crop
OL,9,Fyields.
